# Droplet deployment (this project)

- **SSH:** `root@168.144.83.192`
- **App dir on droplet:** `/root/klimate-kundli` — **not** `/opt/klimate-kundli`
- **Prewarm cache:** `/root/klimate-kundli/data/cache.sqlite` (+ WAL sidecars)

Pull all three SQLite files to local `./data/` (stop local dev server first):

```bash
mkdir -p data
scp root@168.144.83.192:/root/klimate-kundli/data/cache.sqlite ./data/
scp root@168.144.83.192:/root/klimate-kundli/data/cache.sqlite-wal ./data/
scp root@168.144.83.192:/root/klimate-kundli/data/cache.sqlite-shm ./data/
```

Or wildcard: `scp root@168.144.83.192:/root/klimate-kundli/data/cache.sqlite* ./data/`

Local default: `CACHE_PATH=./data/cache.sqlite` (`.env.example`).
